[!] MAIN MODE: -entropy
[!] ======================================================================
[!] Purpose:
[!] Use input as entropy bytes source for mnemonic pipeline.

[!] Enable:
[!] -entropy                       Default entropy path.

[!] Submodes:
[!] -entropy 1                     sha256.
[!] -entropy 2                     sha512.
[!] -entropy 3                     keccak256.
[!] -entropy 4                     sha3-256.
