[!] -ton / -TON                    TON mnemonic style toggle.
[!] -round N                       Plus/minus rounds around each generated key.
[!]
[!] Thread-split / invert modes:
[!] -pass_thread                   One entropy input per round; passphrase candidates
[!]                                from -pass/-passbrute are split across GPU threads/GPUs.
[!]                                This is for explicit input/file/STDIN flows, not PRNG,
[!]                                seq/random, hexset, or recovery branches.
[!] -der_thread                    One entropy/passphrase source per round; derivation
[!]                                paths from -d/-d-type/-d-dot are split across GPU threads/GPUs.
[!]                                Also supported with -entropy -prng/-prng64 generation.
[!]                                Do not combine with -pass_thread, -hexset, or recovery.
