[!] -end HEX                       Last entropy/source point for seq branch.
[!] -step HEX                      Step between seq points, default 1.
[!] -back                          Walk backward from -start.
[!] -both                          Without -end: walk both directions around -start.
[!]                                With -start/-end: + starts at -start, - starts at -end.
[!] -random                        Without -start: standalone random entropy; with -start/-end: seq-random.
[!] -n N                           Random/check window size for seq-random branch.
[!]
[!] PRNG mode:
