[!] -hex                            ON: input line is 64 hex chars. OFF: raw 32-byte flow.
[!]
[!] Sequential private-key mode:
[!] -start HEX                      First private key in hex.
[!] -end HEX                        Last private key in hex.
[!] -step HEX                       Step between private keys, default 1.
[!] -back                           Walk backward from -start.
[!] -both                           Without -end: walk both directions around -start.
[!]                                 With -start/-end: + starts at -start, - starts at -end.
[!] -random                         With -start/-end, choose random points inside that range.
[!] -n NUMBER                       Seq-random span/check window where supported.
[!]
[!] PRNG mode:
[!] -prng                           Use internal 32-bit PRNG backend.
[!] -prng64                         Use internal 64-bit PRNG backend.
[!] -gen LIST                       Generator IDs list/range.
[!] -mode LIST                      Byte extraction mode IDs list/range.
[!] -byte LIST                      Generated byte sizes list/range.
[!] -shift LIST                     Skip counts list/range.
[!] -s HEX                          PRNG start seed.
[!] -e HEX                          PRNG end seed.
[!]
[!] Hexset sequential mode:
[!] -hexset HEXDIGITS               Hex alphabet, 1..16 unique nibbles in user order.
[!] -start HEX                      Required even-length hex lower bound.
[!] -end HEX                        Optional even-length hex upper bound.
[!]                                 Base -priv only; not supported in -priv 0..6 or -priv -recovery.
[!]
[!] Mutation submodes:
[!] -priv 0                         256-bit circular left rotation combinations.
