[!]     -pb LIST                    Byte positions for mode 1, default 1-32.
[!] -priv 2                         Random byte change combinations.
[!] -priv 3                         16 sha256 + 16 keccak variants per key.
[!] -priv 4                         +1 for each next byte pattern.
[!] -priv 5                         +1 over all bytes.
[!] -priv 6                         Repeat first N hex symbols over the full 64-hex key.
[!]     -pb LIST                    Pattern length list/range(s), example: -pb 1,2,3-6.
