[!]
[!] Performance / format flags:
[!] -round N                        Plus/minus rounds around each generated key.
[!] -keys N                         Keys per chunk; rounded up to 1024 steps. Default: 1024.
[!] -chunk N                        Chunks per thread. Default: 1.
[!] -legacy                         Use legacy sequential/random logic.
[!] -em                             Enable secp256k1 endomorphism for -priv seq/random.
[!] -scalar                         Treat 32-byte input as ed25519 scalar.
[!] -LE                             With -scalar: scalar input is little-endian.
[!] -shash                          Treat 32-byte input as ed25519 hash(seed pre-clamp).
[!]
[!] Examples:
[!] ./METAL_CRYPTO_TOOLKIT -priv -hex -i keys_hex.txt -c cuspex -bf bloom.blf
[!] ./METAL_CRYPTO_TOOLKIT -priv -start 1 -end ffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffff -step 1 -c c
[!] ./METAL_CRYPTO_TOOLKIT -priv 6 -pb 3-6 -c c -bf bloom.blf
)HELP");
}

