[!]   $ethereum$w*<encseed_hex>*<ethaddr20_hex>*<bkp16_hex>
[!]   JSON files containing "encseed", "ethaddr" and "bkp" fields.
[!]
[!] GPU worker:
[!] For each candidate password:
[!]   1. PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256(password, password, 2000) -> AES-128 key.
[!]   2. AES-128-CBC decrypt encseed and validate PKCS#7 padding.
[!]   3. Keccak(seed) -> private key.
[!]   4. Keccak(seed || 0x02)[0..15] checks bkp16, then full secp256k1 ETH address verification.
[!]
[!] Enable:
[!] -ethpresale FILE1 FILE2 ...      Load explicit presale JSON/hash files.
[!] -ethpresale -f DIR               Recursively scan .txt/.hash/.json/.wallet/no-extension files.
